There are so, so many places around the world where plumbing can't handle toilet paper. In almost every country in Latin America, Asia and Africa you'll need to throw it in a bin, in a lot of European countries too. It does not lead to shit particles everywhere and is not particularly more unsanitary. Those shit particles spread anyway due to flushing, it doesn't really matter whether you throw the paper in the toilet or a trash can.

&amp;#x200B;

See [https://wheredoiputthepaper.com/](https://wheredoiputthepaper.com/) for reference.
